## 安全修复建议

### 1. 禁用或替代序列化

```php
// 使用 JSON 替代（推荐）
$data = json_decode($input, true);
$stored = json_encode($data);

// 如必须使用，配置严格白名单
$data = unserialize($input, ['allowed_classes' => ['DateTime', 'stdClass']]);
```

### 2. 签名验证

```php
class SecureSerializer {
    private static $key = 'your-secret-key-here';

    public static function encode($data) {
        $serialized = serialize($data);
        $signature = hash_hmac('sha256', $serialized, self::$key);
        return base64_encode($signature . '|' . $serialized);
    }

    public static function decode($input) {
        $decoded = base64_decode($input);
        if (strpos($decoded, '|') === false) {
            throw new Exception('Invalid format');
        }

        list($signature, $serialized) = explode('|', $decoded, 2);
        $expected = hash_hmac('sha256', $serialized, self::$key);

        if (!hash_equals($expected, $signature)) {
            throw new Exception('Signature verification failed');
        }

        return unserialize($serialized, ['allowed_classes' => false]);
    }
}
```

### 3. Phar 防护

```php
// php.ini 配置
phar.readonly = On

// 代码层面过滤
function sanitizePath($path) {
    // 移除 phar 协议
    $path = preg_replace('#^phar://#i', '', $path);

    // 检测伪装
    if (file_exists($path)) {
        $finfo = finfo_open(FILEINFO_MIME_TYPE);
        $mime = finfo_file($finfo, $path);

        // 检查是否为真实图片
        if (!in_array($mime, ['image/jpeg', 'image/png', 'image/gif'])) {
            throw new Exception('Invalid file type');
        }

        // 检查文件内容
        $content = file_get_contents($path);
        if (strpos($content, '__HALT_COMPILER') !== false) {
            throw new Exception('Phar file detected');
        }
    }

    return $path;
}
```

